t(L+"OtherRegionsUpgradeToNational", r"PROF. KORR: Now…\p{PLAYER}{KUN} and {RIVAL}, I've had the two\nof you help me study COMPANIONS.\pThanks to your help, new facts\nare coming to light.\pIt appears that out here in the\nOUTER RIM, there are also COMPANIONS\lfrom other sectors.\pIt goes to show how rich and varied\nthe worlds of the OUTER RIM\lhappen to be.\pThat's why I think it's necessary for\nme to upgrade your DATAPAD to\lGALACTIC Mode.\pHere, let me see your DATAPADS.$")
