t(L+"DontHaveAnyRoomForPokemon", r"Oh, you don't have any room for\nthis COMPANION.$")
t(L+"MayWhatNextImStayingHere", r"MIRA: {PLAYER}{KUN}, after this…\nWhat are you going to do?\pAre you going to keep battling\nand sharpening your skills?\pOr are you going to try filling\nthe GALACTIC DATAPAD?\pI'm staying here to help the PROF.$")
